---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: Talk to Mindfizz about a presentation, report, decision tool or complex communication project.
navKey: contact
permalink: /contact/index.html
---
<section class="contact-page">
  <div class="contact-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Have something complicated to explain<span class="red-stop">?</span></h1>
    <p>Tell us what you are working on, who needs to understand it and where you are in the process. We can start with notes, drafts, data, interviews or existing documents.</p>
    <div class="contact-direct">
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}"><span>Telephone</span>{{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><span>Email</span>{{ site.email }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form class="contact-form" action="/mindfizz_contact.php" method="post" accept-charset="UTF-8">
    <h2>Tell us about your project</h2>
    <div class="form-status form-status-success" data-form-success role="status" tabindex="-1" hidden>Thanks. Your message has been sent. We’ll get back to you as soon as we can.</div>
    <div class="form-status form-status-error" data-form-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden>Sorry, something went wrong. Please email studio@mindfizz.com instead.</div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Name<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required></label>
      <label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="160" required></label>
    </div>
    <label>Organisation <small>optional</small><input name="organisation" type="text" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160"></label>
    <label>What are you creating, and what do you need help with?<textarea name="message" maxlength="3000" placeholder="For example: a board presentation in September, with an early draft ready for review…" required></textarea></label>
    <div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
    <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Discuss my project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    <p class="form-note">No obligation. Just a practical conversation about your project. We’ll only use these details to reply and won’t add you to a mailing list. Read our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p>
  </form>
</section>
